    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This section documents meta processes by the Libs team.",
      "source_hash": 2866864643599270089,
      "context_hash": 6402058064549817461,
      "translation": "이 절은 라이브러리 팀의 메타 프로세스를 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "libs team": "라이브러리 팀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:32.527962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Where to find us",
      "source_hash": 8888397198893429678,
      "context_hash": 8103951822810222140,
      "translation": "우리를 찾을 수 있는 곳",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:32.527962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [`rust-lang/libs-team`](https://github.com/rust-lang/libs-team) GitHub repository is the home of the Libs team.",
      "source_hash": 10777899933768053254,
      "context_hash": 15805470552574881437,
      "translation": "[`rust-lang/libs-team`](https://github.com/rust-lang/libs-team) GitHub 저장소는 라이브러리 팀의 본거지입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "libs team": "라이브러리 팀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:32.527963Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It has details on current project groups, upcoming meetings, and the status of tracking issues.",
      "source_hash": 18286396040968140608,
      "context_hash": 16222090679365052814,
      "translation": "현재 진행 중인 프로젝트 그룹, 예정된 회의, 추적 이슈의 상태에 대한 세부 정보가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:32.527963Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The Libs team hangs out primarily in [the rust-lang Zulip](https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/) these days in the `#t-libs` stream.",
      "source_hash": 13414556407812300483,
      "context_hash": 11396984968268697752,
      "translation": "라이브러리 팀은 요즘 주로 [rust-lang Zulip](https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/)의 `#t-libs` 스트림에서 활동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "libs team": "라이브러리 팀",
        "Rust": "Rust",
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:50.197288Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "You can also find out more details about [Zulip and how the Rust community uses it](../platforms/zulip.md).",
      "source_hash": 3333386251026677881,
      "context_hash": 10906967368282798734,
      "translation": "[Zulip과 Rust 커뮤니티가 이를 사용하는 방식](../platforms/zulip.md)에 대해서도 더 자세히 알아볼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:50.197290Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
